OL,3,GNEWSAFive deny smuggling as part of
OL,4,AThailand international drug ring
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has admitted conspiring to
OL,7,Fsmuggle cannabis after two teenagers
OL,8,Fwere suspected to have been trafficked
OL,9,Fto Thailand as part of an international
OL,10,Fdrug ring.
OL,12,FThe two 17-year-olds were arrested by
OL,13,FThai authorities in June on suspicion
OL,14,Fof acting as drug couriers, after they
OL,15,Fwere allegedly caught carrying 64kg
OL,16,F(141lb) of cannabis "concealed within
OL,17,Ftheir suitcases" while trying to travel
OL,18,Fback to the UK.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
