OL,3,GNEWSAFive deny smuggling as part of
OL,4,AThailand international drug ring
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatrick O'Driscoll, 30, pleaded guilty
OL,7,Fto one drug-related charge and was
OL,8,Fremanded in custody at Cardiff Crown
OL,9,FCourt on Monday.
OL,11,FFive other defendants denied charges
OL,12,Frelating to drug smuggling and
OL,13,Fconspiring to arrange travel with a
OL,14,Fview to exploitation, while one did not
OL,15,Fenter a plea.
